<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<array>
	<dict>
		<key>version</key>
		<string>1.6.3</string>
		<key>items</key>
		<array>
			<dict>
				<key>tag</key>
				<string>优化</string>
				<key>text</key>
				<string>充电卡片电池型号改为显示电池健康度百分比，按电池上报的额定满充容量与设计容量计算；无法取得时显示占位。</string>
			</dict>
		</array>
	</dict>
	<dict>
		<key>version</key>
		<string>1.6.2</string>
		<key>items</key>
		<array>
			<dict>
				<key>tag</key>
				<string>优化</string>
				<key>text</key>
				<string>充电卡片容量区改为显示电池最大容量，替代原设计容量；百分比电量计上无法取得时显示占位。</string>
			</dict>
		</array>
	</dict>
	<dict>
		<key>version</key>
		<string>1.6.1</string>
		<key>items</key>
		<array>
			<dict>
				<key>tag</key>
				<string>修复</string>
				<key>text</key>
				<string>充电卡片的预计充满时间不再长时间停留在估算中；接电稳定约半分钟即按当前速度给出估时，实测窗口成熟后自动替换为更准的数值。</string>
			</dict>
			<dict>
				<key>tag</key>
				<string>新增</string>
				<key>text</key>
				<string>电池未上报厂商时，充电卡片按电池序列号前缀显示封装厂商并标注为推断。</string>
			</dict>
		</array>
	</dict>
	<dict>
		<key>version</key>
		<string>1.6.0</string>
		<key>items</key>
		<array>
			<dict>
				<key>tag</key>
				<string>新增</string>
				<key>text</key>
				<string>充电卡片新增电池循环次数；电池未上报时显示占位，替换原本次净增。</string>
			</dict>
		</array>
	</dict>
	<dict>
		<key>version</key>
		<string>1.5.10</string>
		<key>items</key>
		<array>
			<dict>
				<key>tag</key>
				<string>新增</string>
				<key>text</key>
				<string>充电卡片读取并显示电池服务上报的厂商与型号；缺失、空值或无效内容统一显示未知，不再依照容量或设备机型推断。</string>
			</dict>
		</array>
	</dict>
</array>
</plist>
